<Verse 1>
[]远处|yuan chu|Under
[G]蔚蓝天空下涌动着|wei lan tian kong xia yong dong zhe|distant azure sky Golden waves
[Em]金色的麦浪 就|jin se de mai lang jiu|of wheat are rising There
[Am7]在那里曾是你和我|zai na li ceng shi ni he wo|we once stood, just you and I still
