<Verse 2>
[]我们|wo men|We sang
[G]曾在田野里歌唱|ceng zai tian ye li ge chang|together in the bright fields
[Em]在冬季盼望  却|zai dong ji pan wang que|In winter we hoped But
[Am7]没能等到阳光下 这|mei neng deng dao yang guang xia zhe|we never saw the bright sun This
[D]秋天的景象 就让|qiu tian de jing xiang jiu rang|autumn's quiet scene Let scat-
[G]失散的誓言飞舞吧|shi san de shi yan fei wu ba|tered vows take wing and rise to sky
[Em]随西风飘荡 就|sui xi feng piao dang jiu|With the west wind they Like
[Am7]像你柔软的长发 曾|xiang ni rou ruan de chang fa ceng|your soft, gentle, flowing hair Your
[D]芬芳我梦乡 嗯嗯|fen fang wo meng xiang en en|soft scent filled my dream en en
